    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.query.what": "提出正式请求,注明构件名称、发现问题的模型视图,以及由此引发的碰撞或冲突,并根据工种需要答复的时间设定期限。",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.query.why": "在会上提过一句、却没有正式记录的冲突,到下次会议就被遗忘了。有日期、有书面记录的询问,才能让问题一直被追踪,直到真正解决为止。",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.review.in.federation": "联合模型",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.review.in.flag": "协调标记",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.review.out.conflict": "已定位的冲突",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.review.out.discipline": "责任专业",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.review.title": "复核联合模型",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.review.what": "打开联合模型,查看协调会上标记出的区域,确认究竟哪个专业的模型需要修改。",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.review.why": "询问提给了错误的专业,一周后又会被打回来。先在联合视图中确认问题源头,才能一次到位地送到正确的桌面上。",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.update.in.answer": "询问答复",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.update.in.conflict": "原始冲突",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.update.in.model": "受影响的模型",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.update.out.updated": "已更新的模型",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.update.out.verified": "已验证的修正",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.update.title": "更新模型",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.update.what": "答复到达后,更新受影响的模型,并对照原始冲突确认修正结果,然后再重新发布给团队。",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.step.update.why": "只有当模型本身反映出修正结果时,这个询问才算真正闭环,否则下次有人重新联合模型时,同样的冲突还会再次出现。",
    "cases.design_query_from_bim_coordination.title": "根据BIM协调结果提出设计询问",
    "cases.draft_an_estimate_with_ai_element_matching.desc": "将导入的构件匹配到成本项,让AI为工程量计价,确认后纳入清单,提交前先做校验。",
    "cases.draft_an_estimate_with_ai_element_matching.step.accept-boq.in.lines": "已确认的计价行",
