    "cases.draft_an_estimate_with_ai_element_matching.step.accept-boq.title": "将计价行纳入清单",
    "cases.draft_an_estimate_with_ai_element_matching.step.accept-boq.what": "将已确认的计价行导入工程量清单,填写或调整相应数量。",
    "cases.draft_an_estimate_with_ai_element_matching.step.accept-boq.why": "清单才是最终用来计价和提交的依据。这一步把数量核对准确,才是决定盈亏的关键所在。",
    "cases.draft_an_estimate_with_ai_element_matching.step.ai-price.in.rates": "参考单价",
    "cases.draft_an_estimate_with_ai_element_matching.step.ai-price.in.scope": "已匹配范围",
