    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.supersede.out.report": "登记状态报告",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.supersede.out.retired": "已作废版本",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.supersede.title": "作废已被替代的版本",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.supersede.what": "将旧版本标记为已作废,使其明确不再使用,并报告登记表状态,让任何人都能一眼看出哪个版本是现行的、哪个已失效。",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.supersede.why": "看起来仍是最新版的作废图纸,是现场返工最常见的原因之一。清楚地作废并报告现行状态,才能确保施工始终依据正确版本。",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.track.in.distribution": "分发清单",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.track.in.register": "现行版本",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.track.in.transmittals": "传递单记录",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.track.out.confirmed": "已确认持有方",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.track.out.matrix": "分发矩阵",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.track.title": "追踪谁持有最新版本",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.track.what": "实时掌握各方持有每张图纸的哪个版本,新版本发布时,确认它已送达所有原先使用被替代版本的人员。",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.track.why": "发布新版本只完成了一半工作,另一半是确认它确实送达。对照模型和登记表追踪分发情况,才能防止分包商悄悄按已作废图纸施工。",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.transmit.in.purpose": "发放目的",
