    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.transmit.title": "通过正式传递单发放图纸",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.transmit.what": "以编号传递单发出每张图纸,记录发放内容、对象、版本和目的,并保留收讫确认。",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.step.transmit.why": "正式传递单是正确版本在指定日期送达正确对象的证明。若某分包按旧图施工,传递单记录能明确谁在何时收到了什么。",
    "cases.manage_the_drawing_register_and_transmittals.title": "管理图纸登记与传递单",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.desc": "登记自有和租赁机械设备,将其工时计入项目,保持定期检验,并按租期报告使用率。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.book-hours.in.register": "设备登记表",
