    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.title": "标记检验和保养",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.what": "根据工时和日期,标记即将到期需要法定检验或保养的机械。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.why": "未经检验的吊装设备或超期未保养的机械是停工和安全风险。提前标记能让设备保持合规并正常运转。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.register.in.hired": "租赁合同",
