    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.register.title": "登记自有和租赁机械设备",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.register.what": "列出每台自有和租赁机械,包括费率、当前小时表读数和保养间隔。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.register.why": "未登记的设备容易被重复租赁或延误保养。一份统一清单是成本和保养管理的共同基础。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.report.in.fleet": "机队登记表",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.report.in.hours": "已登记设备工时",
