    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.report.out.report": "使用率报告",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.report.title": "报告使用率和闲置设备",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.report.what": "报告整个机队的使用率和闲置时间,让你看清哪些设备在创造价值、哪些在闲置。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.report.why": "闲置的租赁设备每天都在烧钱。使用率数据能告诉你该退租什么、该调走什么,而不是靠猜测。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.title": "管理机械设备登记",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.desc": "打开当前图纸版本,添加批注供设计团队查看,并将新版本与已作废版本叠加对比,准确看出改动内容和位置。",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.in.new": "新版本",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.in.old": "已作废版本",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.out.changes": "高亮改动内容",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.out.overlay": "版本叠加图",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.title": "与旧版本对比",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.what": "将新版本叠加在已作废图纸上,让工具高亮每一条位置有变的线条,这样你看到的是真实的改动,而不是仅仅依赖修订云线。",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.why": "设计团队并不总是将所有改动都用云线标出。看到真实差异,才能避免一处悄悄改动的尺寸因无人察觉而被错误施工。",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.open.in.files": "项目图纸文件",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.open.in.sheet": "图纸编号",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.open.out.sheet": "现行图纸",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.open.out.status": "已确认的版本与日期",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.open.title": "打开当前图纸版本",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.open.what": "在项目文件中找到该图纸并打开其最新版本,核对版本字母和日期,确保你批注的是现行图纸而非已作废版本。",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.open.why": "在上月图纸上做的批注一交上去就白费了,更糟的是,可能让设计团队去修正一个早已改动过的细节。每次都从受控的当前版本开始。",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.redline.in.issues": "现场冲突与疑问",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.redline.in.sheet": "现行图纸",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.redline.out.comments": "设计问询",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.redline.out.markup": "已批注图纸",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.redline.title": "在图纸上批注",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.redline.what": "在图纸上凡是与现场冲突或需要设计确认之处,用云线、尺寸和批注标出,并将每条批注指向对应的设计团队。",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.redline.why": "在实际图纸上清晰标注,能让设计人员准确知道位置和问题所在,使问询以正式修订的形式返回,而不是拖延数周的模糊邮件往来。",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.title": "批注并对比图纸版本",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.desc": "将拟采购的产品连同技术资料提交设计方审核,对照技术规格进行核查,获批后再放行下单。",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.release.in.approval": "审批决定",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.release.in.product": "已批准产品",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.release.out.linked": "关联报审的订单",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.release.out.order": "采购订单",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.release.title": "放行下单",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.release.what": "报审获批后,针对已签核的产品发出采购订单,并在订单上注明报审编号,确保供应商和仓库交付的就是获批产品,不多不少。",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.release.why": "审批只有在现场实际到货的正是获批产品时才有意义。将订单与报审编号关联,才能防止供应商悄悄替换成更便宜的替代品。",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.review.in.spec": "技术规格要求",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.review.in.submittal": "已提交的报审",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.review.out.decision": "审批决定",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.review.out.deviations": "记录的偏差",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.review.title": "对照技术规格核查",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.review.what": "逐条对照技术规格中的性能、饰面和标准要求核对提交的产品,记录结果:批准、附条件批准或拒绝并注明原因。设计方接受的任何偏差都要记录,以免日后被质疑。",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.review.why": "经过核查的报审,是在替代品被施工前而非施工后被发现的关键节点。记录的审批决定,能在客户质疑实际安装产品与图纸不符时保护你。",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.submit.in.clause": "技术规格条款",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.submit.in.data": "技术资料与证书",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.submit.in.product": "拟用产品",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.submit.out.deadline": "需求截止日期",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.submit.out.submittal": "已提交的报审",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.submit.title": "提交报审",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.submit.what": "为拟使用的产品发起报审,附上技术资料、样品和证书,注明所依据的技术规格条款。提交给需审批的设计方,并设定与订购期限相符的需求截止日期,以确保满足工期。",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.step.submit.why": "未经批准就订购材料,往往会导致收到一整批错误产品,并引发谁来承担费用的争执。带日期的报审记录也约束着设计方,若批准拖延导致订单延误,记录会一目了然。",
    "cases.material_submittal_and_approval.title": "获取材料报审批准",
    "cases.milestone_progress_before_drawdown.desc": "确认计划确实已达到该里程碑,与挣值数据交叉核对,然后再批准释放相应资金的估值。",
