    "cases.plan_repetitive_work_with_takt_and_line_of_balance.step.takt-time.why": "稳定的节拍能避免各专业互相干扰,也能让延误在发生当天就被发现,而不是一个月后才察觉。",
    "cases.plan_repetitive_work_with_takt_and_line_of_balance.step.zones.in.layout": "平面图",
