    "cases.plan_repetitive_work_with_takt_and_line_of_balance.step.zones.why": "重复性工作只有在分区均衡、各处顺序一致时才能顺畅推进。这是制定节拍计划的基础工作。",
    "cases.plan_repetitive_work_with_takt_and_line_of_balance.title": "用节拍法和平衡线规划重复性工作",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.desc": "在工作包开始前编制施工方案和风险评估:描述安全作业方法,识别危险源和控制措施,分配责任,送审并发布,并确保现场可查阅。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.available.in.approved": "已批准的方案与评估",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.available.in.crew": "施工班组",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.available.out.briefed": "已交底的班组",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.available.out.filed": "已归档至项目文件的方案",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.available.title": "确保现场可查阅",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.available.what": "将已发布的方案和评估存入项目文件,让班组和任何检查人员都能查阅,并在工作包开始前向班组交底。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.available.why": "锁在办公室里的文件无法保护任何人。现场持有最新版本并向班组交底,才能使其成为真正起作用的文件,也证明作业是经过安全策划的。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.hazards.in.method": "施工方案",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.hazards.in.steps": "工作步骤",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.hazards.out.controls": "控制措施与风险等级",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.hazards.out.hazards": "危险源清单",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.hazards.title": "识别危险源和控制措施",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.hazards.what": "逐一梳理每个步骤带来的危险源,为每项危险设定控制措施,并对控制前后的风险进行评级,使危险程度一目了然。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.hazards.why": "风险评估是证明施工方法安全、而非仅仅可行的环节。对控制前后风险的评级,清楚说明了每项控制措施存在的原因以及没有它会怎样。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.method.in.drawings": "图纸与平面布置",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.method.in.package": "工作包范围",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.method.out.method": "施工方案",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.method.out.sequence": "施工顺序",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.method.title": "描述安全作业方法",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.method.what": "用班组能够遵循的通俗语言,逐步说明该工作包将如何实际实施,包括顺序、机械设备、通道以及涉及人员。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.method.why": "施工方案把模糊的计划转化为大家一致认同的作业方式。顺序一旦写明,整个班组就能按同一图景作业,而不是各自临场发挥。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.responsibilities.in.controls": "控制措施",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.responsibilities.in.team": "现场团队与角色",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.responsibilities.out.matrix": "责任矩阵",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.responsibilities.out.owners": "已指定责任人",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.responsibilities.title": "分配责任",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.responsibilities.what": "为每项控制措施和检查指定负责人——主管、吊装指定负责人、急救员——使方案中的每项职责都有明确的责任人。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.responsibilities.why": "没有署名的控制措施等于无人执行。分配责任才能让书面文件真正落实到现场行动上。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.review.in.rams": "施工方案与风险评估初稿",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.review.in.reviewer": "负责的管理人员",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.review.out.approved": "已批准的方案与评估",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.review.out.revision": "编号与版本",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.review.title": "送审并发布",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.review.what": "将方案和评估送交负责的管理人员审阅,记录其意见,然后发布带有清晰编号和版本的已批准版本,确保只有一份现行版本。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.step.review.why": "评审能在作业开始前而非事故发生后发现漏洞。有跟踪的发布和版本记录,能确保班组绝不会使用过时或未经批准的方法。",
    "cases.prepare_a_method_statement_and_risk_assessment.title": "编制施工方案和风险评估",
    "cases.prepare_an_interim_payment_application.desc": "编制月度中期付款申请:计量截至目前的已完成工作,按合同总额加已同意变更进行估值,扣除保留金,连同支持材料一并提交,以便全额核证。",
