    "cases.prepare_an_interim_payment_application.step.issue.out.backup": "支持材料包",
    "cases.prepare_an_interim_payment_application.step.issue.title": "提交带支持材料的申请",
    "cases.prepare_an_interim_payment_application.step.issue.what": "编制申请,附上计量明细、变更账目和保留金计算,并在计费周期结束前提交,确保落在付款条款期限内。",
    "cases.prepare_an_interim_payment_application.step.issue.why": "延迟提交或缺少支持材料的申请,最容易在时间压力下被削减。及时且证据齐全,才能获得全额核证,而不是被追问。",
    "cases.prepare_an_interim_payment_application.step.measure.in.boq": "工程量清单条目",
