    "cases.produce_a_short_interval_lookahead.step.commit.out.plan": "周工作计划",
    "cases.produce_a_short_interval_lookahead.step.commit.out.ppc": "承诺兑现率",
    "cases.produce_a_short_interval_lookahead.step.commit.title": "确定周计划",
    "cases.produce_a_short_interval_lookahead.step.commit.what": "发布真正已具备条件的周工作计划,让每位工长承诺其班组本周将完成的内容,周末衡量这些承诺实际兑现了多少。",
    "cases.produce_a_short_interval_lookahead.step.commit.why": "只将真正具备条件的工作纳入计划,才能让班组信任并达成计划。逐周追踪承诺兑现率,是判断进度计划是否真正受控的最诚实的早期信号。",
    "cases.produce_a_short_interval_lookahead.step.constraints.in.blockers": "任务制约因素",
