    "cases.quantities_from_bim.step.validate.out.report": "验证报告",
    "cases.quantities_from_bim.step.validate.title": "验证算量结果",
    "cases.quantities_from_bim.step.validate.what": "运行验证规则,确认映射的工程量完整一致,并在规则要求处确认存在分类信息。",
    "cases.quantities_from_bim.step.validate.why": "一个看似完整的模型仍可能缺少定价所需的关键属性。验证能在清单送达客户前,发现未映射的构件和空白分类。",
    "cases.quantities_from_bim.title": "从BIM模型获取工程量",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.desc": "口头指示不留证据。趁记忆犹新登记通话内容,以书面形式回复确认,若涉及范围变更,在动工前先启动变更记录。",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.confirm.in.log": "带日期的通话记录",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.confirm.in.understanding": "已理解的指示",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.confirm.out.filed": "已归档往来函件",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.confirm.out.note": "确认函",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.confirm.title": "以书面形式确认",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.confirm.what": "向发出指示的人发送一份简短的口头指示确认函,说明你的理解,以及除非另有通知,否则你将据此执行。将其归档到项目下。",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.confirm.why": "口头指示只有在以书面形式确认且未被反驳时才具有约束力。确认函把一次走廊闲谈变成了一条你可以依据并在日后据此获得付款的指示。",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.log.in.call": "口头指示",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.log.in.caller": "来电人与时间",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.log.out.entry": "带日期的通话记录",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.log.out.record": "已记录指示",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.log.title": "登记通话",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.log.what": "通话结束后立即登记:谁打来的、何时打来的,以及原话内容而非你自己的转述。趁细节还记得清楚时就要完成。",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.log.why": "两周后,没有人能就电话里说了什么达成一致。当时那个小时内写下的带日期记录,是事实与各执一词之间的关键区别。",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.record.in.note": "确认函",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.record.in.scope": "范围变更",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.record.out.entitlement": "已记录的权益",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.record.out.order": "变更单",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.record.title": "如范围有变,启动变更记录",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.record.what": "如果指示增加或改变了范围,现在就在动工之前发起变更单,使增量部分基于一个已商定的理由被记录下来,并让你的权益开始计时。",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.step.record.why": "先干活、事后补手续的工作往往拿不到钱。在动工前启动变更记录,才能防止口头指示变成免费扩大的范围。",
    "cases.record_a_verbal_instruction_for_the_record.title": "为口头指示留存记录",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.desc": "趁细节还清晰时登记未遂事件,查明原因并制定纠正措施,然后在巡查中核实控制措施是否真正落实。",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.action.in.controls": "失效的控制措施",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.action.in.report": "已登记的未遂事件",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.action.out.action": "纠正措施",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.action.out.cause": "根本原因",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.action.title": "查明原因并采取行动",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.action.what": "不要只看直接诱因,要追问控制措施为何失效,然后制定纠正措施,指定责任人和截止日期,并在现场其他地方存在同样风险时向更多班组交底。",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.action.why": "把责任归咎于失误的工人无法解决任何问题;缺失的护栏或不良通道同样会伤到下一个人。解决根本原因,才是真正消除隐患,而不是转移隐患。",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.report.in.event": "未遂事件观察",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.report.in.scene": "现场照片",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.report.out.report": "已登记的未遂事件",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.report.out.severity": "潜在伤害等级",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.report.title": "登记未遂事件",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.report.what": "记录事件发生的地点、时间、涉及人员以及可能造成的伤害,并附现场照片。在同一班次内完成记录,避免记忆淡化和现场被清理。",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.report.why": "未遂事件是一次免费的预警:它所指向的伤害尚未发生。趁记忆犹新登记下来,才能在下一次真正演变成事故之前修正根本原因。",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.verify.in.action": "纠正措施",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.verify.in.walk": "巡查",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.verify.out.closed": "未遂事件已关闭",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.verify.out.verified": "已核实控制措施",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.verify.title": "在巡查中核实整改情况",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.verify.what": "在下一次巡查中回到现场,确认纠正措施确已落实并持续有效,并附上证据关闭该未遂事件记录。",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.step.verify.why": "办公室里标记为已完成的措施,并不等同于地面上真正立起来的防护设施。到现场核实,才能把良好意图变成工人能够真正依靠的保护。",
    "cases.report_and_action_a_near_miss.title": "报告并处理未遂事件",
    "cases.review_and_mitigate_project_risks.desc": "按固定节奏检查风险登记表,如实评估可能性和影响,在风险变成实际问题之前指定缓解责任人。",
    "cases.review_and_mitigate_project_risks.step.mitigate.in.risks": "现存风险",
