    "cases.review_and_mitigate_project_risks.step.review.title": "检查风险登记表",
    "cases.review_and_mitigate_project_risks.step.review.what": "逐一检查登记表上所有未结风险,依据当前掌握的信息重新评估其可能性和影响,并退出已经真正过去的风险。",
    "cases.review_and_mitigate_project_risks.step.review.why": "无人复查的风险登记表只会积累陈旧条目,并掩盖本月真正重要的那两三项风险。",
    "cases.review_and_mitigate_project_risks.title": "检查并缓解风险登记表",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.desc": "与客户一起巡查已完工工程,依据验收标准记录合格与不合格项,将缺陷清单降至零,并发出正式验收。",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.accept.in.record": "检查记录",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.accept.in.zero": "缺陷清单为零",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.accept.out.defects": "缺陷责任期已开始",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.accept.out.signed": "已签署验收",
