    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.new-project.what": "咨询中标后,将其立为在建项目,并延续客户和工程范围信息。",
    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.new-project.why": "将已中标的项目在新系统中重新录入,会丢失细节并浪费一整天时间。转化操作能保留历史记录,让交付工作干净利落地开始。",
    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.opportunity.in.client": "客户记录",
    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.opportunity.in.scope": "咨询范围",
    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.opportunity.out.opportunity": "商机记录",
    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.opportunity.out.stage": "阶段与中标概率",
    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.opportunity.title": "创建并跟踪商机",
    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.opportunity.what": "打开商机,设置其价值、阶段和中标概率,并记录每一次相关的通话和会议。",
    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.opportunity.why": "看不见的商机管道无法预测。阶段和中标概率告诉你该跟进什么、该为什么项目配置人力。",
    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.tender.in.project": "在建项目",
    "cases.track_an_opportunity_from_enquiry_to_tender.step.tender.in.scope": "项目范围",
